			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 762260101,
					"content": "梅拉快看，我们把你的画都找回来啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260102,
					"content": "♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260103,
					"content": "嘿嘿，不用客气啦。毕竟这些画还有我们的功劳呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260104,
					"content": "派蒙什么时候能听懂梅拉的话了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 762260105,
					"content": "哎呀，我都和你一起去了好多次银月之庭了，能听懂梅拉的意思也不奇怪吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260106,
					"content": "那梅拉说画是怎么丢的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 762260107,
					"content": "呃…这个…我理解一下哦…梅拉说…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260108,
					"content": "可能是其他月灵偷走的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260109,
					"content": "嗯…也可能是月亮上那些神奇的运输机关偷走的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260110,
					"content": "嗯…还可能是哥伦比娅偷走的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260111,
					"content": "这个绝对不可能吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 762260112,
					"content": "欸？对哦…难道我理解错了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260113,
					"content": "原来只是连蒙带猜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 762260114,
					"content": "哼哼，学习外语哪有那么容易啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762260115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 762260115,
					"content": "我需要一个好老师，等有机会，我要请哥伦比娅好好教教我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
